<title>USA: BT Office Products to acquire co.</title>
<headline>BT Office Products to acquire co.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Office Products International Inc said Tuesday it has an agreement in principle to acquire privately held Kuipers Centrum voor Kantoorefficiency BV, an office products distributor in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. The deal is expected to close by the end of the year.</p>
<p>BT Office said it intends to operate Kuipers as an individual company, maintaining its own structure and identity.</p>
</text>
